          "items": [
            "🌟 First Floor — Private Guest Suite + Full Living Area<br>• Full in-law style suite perfect for grandparents, teens, or guests wanting privacy<br>• Murphy Bed + Futon that Lays Flat - Full Kitchen and Living Area<br>• Direct access to the Main Entryway<br>• Direct access to Private Pool & Hot Tub<br><br><br>🌟 Second Floor — Three Bedrooms + Balcony Views<br>Master Suite<br>• King Bed<br>• Full private bathroom<br>• Balcony with beautiful neighborhood views<br><br>Bunk Room<br>• Two Twin Beds - Single Bunk<br>• Shares a full bathroom<br><br>Double Bedroom<br>• Two Full Beds<br>• Full private bedroom<br>• Lovely views overlooking the pool and charming neighborhood<br><br><br>🌟 Third Floor — Living Level + Gulf View Moments<br>• Primary King Suite with spa-inspired bathroom<br>• Sleeper Queen Sofa Couch<br>• Bright, open living room filled with natural light<br>• Peek-a-boo Gulf views from multiple angles<br>• Modern kitchen with island seating<br>• Dedicated dining area for group meals<br>• Spacious balcony perfect for morning coffee or sunset breezes<br><br><br>You’re booking the 30A lifestyle: elevated, walkable, family-friendly, and unforgettable.<br><br>~ 4 Bikes Included<br>~ Game Room with Pac Man Arcade and Foosball <br>~ Private Pool & Hot Tub<br>~ Brand New Gas Grill<br>~ Quick Beach Walk<br>~ 2 King Beds<br>~ 2 Queen Beds (1 being a sleeper sofa)<br>~ 2 Twin Beds<br>~ 2 Full Size Beds<br><br>✨ Arrive to a spotless, hotel-style clean.<br>Starter essentials included: bathroom + kitchen + laundry.<br><br><br>🌴 Explore the Best of 30A — Where Memories Are Made<br>✨ Alys Beach — Where Luxury Meets the Sand<br>✨ Rosemary Beach — Family, Food, and Charm<br>✨ 30Avenue — Dining, Shopping & Events<br><br>🌊 Beach Days You’ll Talk About for Years<br><br>⛳ Championship Golf Nearby<br><br>🍽️ Iconic Restaurants That Define 30A Dining<br>This area is packed with legendary spots, including:<br>• Citizen (Alys Beach) – Coastal fine dining with unforgettable cocktails<br>• Raw & Juicy (Alys Beach) – Organic juices, brunch, and famous Instagram moments<br>• Charlie’s Donuts – Alys Beach tradition, beloved by families<br>• Pescado Rooftop (Rosemary Beach) – Upscale sunset dining with Gulf views<br>• Havana Beach Bar & Grill (Rosemary) – Elegant coastal flavors in a stunning setting<br>• Cowgirl Kitchen – Relaxed bites, tacos, and easy lunches in the square<br>• Cuvee 30A (30Avenue) – Upscale seafood & steaks<br>• Amici / amigos (30Avenue) – Italian vibes + Tex-Mex<br><br>🛍️ Boutique Shopping & Coastal Finds<br>Stroll through the curated shops of Alys Beach, explore Rosemary’s cobblestone-lined boutiques, or spend an afternoon at 30Avenue, home to upscale fashion, home décor, galleries, and seasonal events.<br><br>🎶 Live Music & Family Hangouts<br>For a fun evening, head to The HUB in Seagrove (now “The Big Chill”), a huge family-friendly gathering spot with:<br>• Live music<br>• Big-screen movie nights<br>• Food stalls<br>• Outdoor seating<br>• Kids’ activities and lawn games<br>It’s the perfect place to end the night after a beach day.<br><br>🎳 Rainy-Day or Off-Beach Fun<br>If you're up for adventure, Top Golf–style attractions and indoor fun await in Panama City Beach, just a short drive away—perfect for family competitions or big group outings.<br><br>Elevator Currently Not Usable",
