        "text": "Outstanding stay! Thomas was absolutely the best. The home was just a few short blocks from the beach (we could even see the ocean from the top balcony) and in close proximity to everything we would want/need. Highly recommend the Donut Hole and Ghost Crab Pizza which are just down the street. The beds were really comfortable and the heated pool and hot tub came in handy for the chilly weather. Lots of beach chairs available which was nice and bikes even come with the place. There was a party one night at the house across the street, but they ended early enough and brought a fun vibe to the neighborhood. It was the perfect place for our beach stay with our pups!",
